<section class="countdown-knowledge three-tool-knowledge" id="countdown-guide" aria-labelledby="countdown-guide-heading">
 <h2 id="countdown-guide-heading">When does Ramadan start? A complete countdown and moon-sighting guide</h2>
 <p><strong>Short answer:</strong> Ramadan begins with the new Hijri month at local sunset. If a community expects its <strong>first daytime fast on Monday</strong>, the first Ramadan evening begins on the <strong>preceding Sunday at Maghrib</strong>. An online date is a planning estimate until an announcement from the authority you follow confirms the month.</p>
